{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:14 2026-10-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:14 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:14 2026-10-19 HKT</p><img alt=\"「小飛俠」爆大冷放到\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/7184f9087c26cd944c2fa3a8ea3ba0c4/2026-10/r3_3.jpg\"/><p>今日沙田第二場爆大冷後，第三場四班千四米又爆岀大冷門，練馬師蔡約翰和華將鍾易禮歷來第二次合作，即憑「小飛俠」一放到底，攜手爆岀一百零二倍大冷勝出，此駒上仗跑同程大敗十五馬位跑包尾，但兩個半星期後再岀即贏馬。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T06:19:05.493188+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:14:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T06:17:35.289006+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T06:17:35.289006+00:00","content_hash":"7c12352d0365559e6ee6511a50c9e0aadc9e21ac5387ebe5fd2ce3a866f51463","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}